== e2e job in workflow ==
301:  e2e:
302-    name: E2E Tests (Playwright)
303-    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
304-    timeout-minutes: 30
305-    # Non-blocking ramp (issue #867): the suite has never run in CI, so the
306-    # first executions will surface real latent failures (the inert
307-    # waitForLivewire() wait, the self-skipping unit-map-boundary spec).
308-    # Ship continue-on-error:true now; promote to required only after two
309-    # consecutive green runs AND the two collateral fixes land (separate PRs,
310-    # preconditions for required status — see #867's git review).
311-    continue-on-error: true
